<title>USA: Evergreen International offers to buy back notes.</title>
<headline>Evergreen International offers to buy back notes.</headline>
<dateline>MCMINNVILLE, Oregon 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen International Aviation Inc said Thursday it offered to buy back senior notes at 110 percent of the principal amount.</p>
<p>The company said it made the proposal to the holders of the outstanding 13.5 percent senior notes, which are due 2002.</p>
<p>It said it received a commitment from a &quot;major financial institution&quot; to give the funds necessary to repurchase the notes. Evergreen operates an air cargo fleet.</p>
</text>
